Z||000005||mrfiero||03-04-2000||10:35 PM||||Fiero56,<P>The VIN on the last Fiero will look like this:<P>1G2PG119_JP226402<P>The blank space is a check digit and varies, but there were 26,402 '88 Fieros built.<P>My Formula is #25304, so it's kind of close to the end.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||3
