Z||000007||mrfiero||03-05-2000||01:34 AM||||I would call that an "early" '88 Fiero, but not one of the first.  I'm guessing it was built in October '87....am I close?  My other Formula is #12839 and I owned a GT #13007, both built in Dec. '87.  I believe these were some of the last ones built in '87 before they went on X-mas break, but I haven't collected enough data to pinpoint the cutoff number.<P>FYI.....they didn't build ANY '88 Fieros during the entire month of January.  Kind of interesting.<BR>||||reg||12
