Z||000009||fiero56||03-05-2000||09:28 AM||||Last 5 numbers for my Formula are 22,823. But, I believe the sticker on the drivers door panel says june(july?) '88. I'd have to check. Is that sticker for the cars assenbly, or the door, or something else?||||reg||1
Z||000010||mrfiero||03-05-2000||02:55 PM||||Phil,<P>Well La-De-Da!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Seriously though,our Fieros were probably built within a day or 2 (at the most) of each other.  Mine's white, what color is yours?  <P>Fiero56,<P>The door jamb sticker is the month/year of when the car was assembled....not just the door.  Yours is likely a late June or early July build.  Another interesting fact....no Fieros have "8/88" on the door jamb even though they were produced until August 16, 1988.  "7/88" was used on all July and August builds.  I've never been able to figure that one out. ||||reg||10
